jopendde
Copyright 2026 Escalante Bio

This product includes software developed at Escalante Bio.

jopendde is a JAX/Equinox translation of OpenDDE
(https://github.com/aurekaresearch/OpenDDE), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Portions of this software are derived from the
OpenDDE model architecture.

The ./OpenDDE directory is a vendored copy of OpenDDE @ 266ce4c (Copyright
Aureka AI Research, Apache-2.0; its LICENSE is retained at OpenDDE/LICENSE).
Only the `opendde/` and `runner/` packages are included, needed for weight
conversion and featurization. The vendored `OpenDDE/pyproject.toml` is modified
from upstream: requires-python raised to >=3.12 and the `cuequivariance-torch`
GPU-kernel dependencies removed (jopendde uses only the plain-torch path).

The module-by-module translation approach follows joltz
(https://github.com/nboyd/joltz).
